{"title":"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jefferson Middle School has the same number of boys and girls. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> of the girls and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />\nof the boys went on a field trip. What fraction of the students on the field trip were girls?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da471fb21489b6f6fe6a27991cda6766df016ed0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{9}{17}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{7}{13}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{2}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\frac{14}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"399\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let there be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> boys and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> girls in the school. We see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/b/3fb3ba4057d0e7cc5fdcb5c045462a8d3e1c4ae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/b/08b0ba6d6e409060c81e28f3b56f9f6f6dec9003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}b+\\frac{2}{3}b=\\frac{17}{12}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" /> kids went on the trip and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3e7f510cfc8e10a976a28f3a85c9d7f406d530.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"23\" height=\"38\" /> kids are girls. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/2/b5243e69e5decac24e96780a75e14114e331c5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{3}{4}b}{\\frac{17}{12}b}=\\frac{9}{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"73\" height=\"47\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/8/83820abb45fbfff16d386a4f71202382e5a9b78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\frac{9}{17}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"62\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~CHECKMATE2021\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using WLOG (Without loss of generativity), Let there be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> boys and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> girls in the school. Now we can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d657193cf71440354fcc5c54819c3ee42423125.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}\\times{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"38\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/3/7e3ec8e20895bcf124d0fe00aeb82dce4e6b0094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}\\times{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"38\" /> to get the total number of students going to the field trip to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Since we already know the number of girls to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We have our answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/18146fadb6707424d12dc456b677ed4a93533328.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/8/83820abb45fbfff16d386a4f71202382e5a9b78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\frac{9}{17}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"62\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~algebraic_algorithmic\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Y4N4L_HcnKY\">https://youtu.be/Y4N4L_HcnKY</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/MnqS_-dUMV8\">https://youtu.be/MnqS_-dUMV8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8\" title=\"2016 AMC 8\">2016 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2016\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_